## Finalize PR 182 review fixes on 0.8.1

Context: This changelog is created directly on the PR implementation branch head (`55766446`) after confirming that the earlier Task 4 changelog commit was not on this branch. The reviewed scope includes all tracked source, test, and documentation fixes introduced since the `0.8.1` merge base (`33b92be6`) for folded `describe_entity` BFS parity and compatibility. The mandatory non-scenario suite was re-run on this exact branch head and recorded here.

Changes:

1. src/back/core/graphdb/GraphDBBackend.py
   Folded BFS SQL path hardened (safe depth cast, alias-aware entity set, exact metadata extraction, one-page response contract).
2. src/back/objects/digitaltwin/DigitalTwin.py
   Removed extra seed counting round trip and delegated BFS pagination metadata to folded backend output.
3. src/back/core/graphdb/neo4j/Neo4jReadOps.py
   Aligned Neo4j folded BFS metadata parity (`seed_count`, `entity_count`, `total`, `has_more`) and strict page slicing.
4. src/back/core/graphdb/neo4j/Neo4jStore.py
   Removed obsolete `count_seeds` passthrough API after folded-page parity alignment.
5. src/api/routers/digitaltwin.py
   Restored additive response metadata and backward-safe `has_more` default mapping.
6. src/api/routers/internal/dtwin.py
   Restored internal payload metadata mapping with backward-safe `has_more` handling.
7. src/agents/tools/graph_formatting.py
   Updated formatter to display exact totals and preserve pagination hints.
8. src/mcp-server/server/formatting.py
   Mirrored formatter contract update for MCP responses (`{count} of {total}` plus `has_more` hint).
9. src/mcp-server/server/tools.py
   Updated tool guidance for exact metadata semantics and `describe_entity` usage recommendations.
10. src/front/templates/partials/dtwin/_query_api.html
    Updated query guidance and sample payload fields for `has_more` and depth/search recommendations.
11. docs/api.md
    Updated `/triples/find` API docs to reflect exact total/entity metadata and usage guidance.
12. docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-25-describe-entity-folded-bfs-design.md
    Captured folded-BFS architecture rationale and benchmark framing used during review fixes.
13. docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-25-describe-entity-folded-bfs-081.md
    Recorded 0.8.1 implementation plan and review-fix sequencing.
14. docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-25-describe-entity-folded-bfs-090.md
    Recorded forward plan for corresponding 0.9.0 follow-up scope.
15. tests/units/dtwin/test_digitaltwin_api.py
    Added/updated folded BFS contract tests (depth cast safety, exact metadata, empty/missing `has_more` compatibility).
16. tests/back/core/digitaltwin/test_digitaltwin_units.py
    Updated domain orchestration tests for one-call folded pagination behavior.
17. tests/units/graphdb/test_neo4j_roundtrip.py
    Added parity assertions for alias expansion, metadata, and strict page-size behavior.
18. tests/units/dtwin/test_internal_triples_find_api.py
    Added regression coverage for missing `has_more` defaulting in internal route mapping.
19. tests/units/agents/test_graph_formatting_context.py
    Added formatter regression checks for exact totals and pagination wording.
20. tests/units/mcp/test_find_response_formatting.py
    Hardened MCP formatter contract test import path and exact-total assertions.

