## Complete MCP session-isolation review fixes

Context: PR #183 isolated tool-call state by MCP session ID but resource reads
still used the shared default bucket, and the original test module silently
skipped because its MCP source path was incorrect. The follow-up applies
session scope to every MCP request and makes missing-session fallback visible.

Changes:

1. src/mcp-server/server/session_scope.py
   Moved session binding from the tool-only hook to the request-wide hook,
   reset scope reliably, and added a once-per-process fallback warning.
2. tests/units/mcp/test_session_isolation.py
   Fixed test discovery and added request/resource, fallback-warning, reset,
   and LRU-eviction regression coverage.
3. docs/mcp.md
   Replaced the obsolete concurrency limitation with the per-session behavior,
   512-session LRU cap, and process-local deployment constraint.
4. changelogs/v0.8.1/LaurentPRAT-DB_2026-09-24.log
   Preserved and moved the original contributor's change record to 0.8.1.

